&lt;p&gt;⚡ &lt;strong&gt;TL;DR:&lt;/strong&gt; Frontend engineering is far more than styling: it owns the browser runtime, interaction, and the human-facing layer. The takeaway is a clear map of what the role actually owns versus the backend, and the modern skills it really demands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

